OL,3,GNEWSAReplica Harry Potter alley set for
OL,4,Amove with house sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the outside, Dylan's terraced
OL,7,Fhouse in Windsor is like many others `
OL,8,Fbut inside, there is a mini magical
OL,9,Fworld created for his daughter.
OL,11,FHe spent weeks during the 2020
OL,12,Fcoronavirus lockdown turning part of
OL,13,Ftheir home into an MDF replica of
OL,14,FDiagon Alley from the Harry Potter
OL,15,Fseries.
OL,17,FElla, then six and now 12, plays down
OL,18,Fthe alley less than she did, but her
OL,19,Fdad said it was still occasionally
OL,20,Fused.
